What is the output of the following program?
```java
class BaseWidget {
    int count = 5;
    BaseWidget() {
        printCount();
    }
    void printCount() {
        System.out.print("Base:" + count + " ");
    }
}
class SubWidget extends BaseWidget {
    int count = 20;
    // Synthesized default constructor SubWidget()
    void printCount() {
        System.out.print("Sub:" + count + " ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new SubWidget();
    }
}
```

